	'week_p' => 'Monday is demonstration and drawing. Tuesday and Wednesday are spent in the booth. Thursday morning is for cutting, bending and review, and Thursday afternoon is clean down and the next week’s drawing. Each week ends with one marked piece on the review rack, so the cohort can see what passed and what must be done again. Nothing is collected for show. The rack is the record of the week.',
